# EngineTest/assets/ holds heavy binaries (models, textures) that shouldn't be
# tracked. Use contents-list pattern (assets/*) not dir pattern (assets/) so
# specific subdirs can be re-included below.
EngineTest/assets/*
!EngineTest/assets/Shaders/
!EngineTest/assets/ReferenceImages/
# M0 神经渲染：训练产物（.pnn 权重 + parity 对拍向量）随库分发，
# TestNeuralWeights 与 NeuralDebugModule 依赖；重训由
# ContentTools/neural/train_image_fit.py 再生成。
!EngineTest/assets/Neural/
# Global *.spv / *.png rules below would still match files under Shaders/ and
# ReferenceImages/. Re-include those file types explicitly per subdir.
!EngineTest/assets/Shaders/**
!EngineTest/assets/ReferenceImages/**
!EngineTest/assets/Neural/**

# Production Vulkan shaders (SPIR-V binaries) — needed by ForwardRenderer on
# Vulkan devices via ShaderRegistry. Re-include the .spv files explicitly.
!Engine/Graphics/Vulkan/shaders/**

# WFC demo needs Kenney tiles + colormap to embed in the WASM binary;
# CI has no BatchConvert pipeline, so the processed assets must live in git.
!EngineTest/assets/Processed/kenney_dungeon_tiles/
!EngineTest/assets/Raw/kenney_dungeon_tiles/Textures/colormap.png

# Testing/Baselines/ 离线渲染基线 PNG（primal-mcp compare 默认引用）；
# Testing/Temporary/ 是 CTest 运行时输出，不跟踪。
!Testing/Baselines/*.png
Testing/Temporary/

.trae/
.venv/
.sisyphus/
graphify-out/

TODO*

# FBX SDK: vendored locally by CMake at configure time (see the FBX_SDK
# auto-vendor block in CMakeLists.txt). Proprietary Autodesk SDK — never commit.
third_party/FBX_SDK/

!Engine/Graphics/RenderPipeline/RenderPasses/Debug/
!Engine/Graphics/RHI/Shaders/Debug/

# Git Worktrees
.worktrees/
worktrees/
.worktrees
build-wt/
.superpowers/
test-output/
.zcode/
.codex/
autoresearch/
build-wasm/
projects_test/

# WFC WASM showcase build outputs (regenerated by CMake)
wfc/*.wasm
wfc/*.js
wfc/*.data

# CMake-generated engine config (contains machine-specific build paths)
# Regenerated from EngineConfig.h.in on every configure; must not be tracked.
Engine/Common/EngineConfig.h
build-release/

# NVIDIA 专有二进制与提取权重(许可证禁止再分发)
third_party/dlss/

# 神经渲染：厂商权重与本地抓取件（许可禁止分发）；SwiftPM 构建树（1.8G）
weights/
Tools/NeuralMLXShim/.build/

# 已停用 CI 机制的产物（ARCHIVE.md §4.4 登记，仅本地保留，不再跟踪）
Docs/completed/CodeReview/
Docs/completed/CI/

# 神经渲染权重与训练产物：体积大且可由训练脚本再生，不入库
# （许可受限的厂商权重另见 weights/、third_party/dlss/ 两条）。
# 例外：EngineTest/assets/Neural/ 的 .pnn/.safetensors 测试夹具随库分发，
# 末行 re-include 保证它们可被（重新）加入；已跟踪状态不受影响。
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.mlpackage
*.mlmodel
sr_output/
!EngineTest/assets/Neural/**

# GI/渲染审计图集与诊断转储（~530M）：本地留存、不入库；索引见 Docs/ARCHIVE.md §4.5。
# README/验证文本随之本地化。*.ppm 为原始像素转储，全局忽略。
Docs/completed/render-comparisons/
Docs/diagnostics/
*.ppm

# GI/SC/DDGI 本地审计/取证脚本：会话级诊断工作流产物，本地留存不入库。
# 已跟踪文件（scripts/test_gi_shader_layout.py 等）不受 ignore 规则影响。
scripts/test_*.py
scripts/audit_*.py
scripts/analyze_*.py
scripts/compare_*.py
scripts/certify_*.py
scripts/make_*.py
!scripts/make_ddgi_strict_spirv.py
!scripts/test_ddgi_strict_spirv.py
scripts/ddgi_*.py
scripts/spgi_plan_*.py
scripts/sponza_sdf_*.py
scripts/gi_ownership_baseline.sh

# Versioned derived mesh BLAS / instance TLAS cache
.primal-cache/

# 本地渲染实验报告、审计证据与派生网页：保留在磁盘，不加入Git。
# 正式结论与交接文档放在Docs/completed，索引在Docs/ARCHIVE.md。
/Docs/reports/

# Vulkan shader compiler timing marker; local scratch, not source.
/Engine/Graphics/Vulkan/[Ss]haders/*.markertest

# 引擎知识文档保存在 Gemini Notebook；Docs 为本地工作副本与短期过程文件。
/Docs/

